  coverage      : field of view scaled to 0.9811 so that EVERY frame covers every pixel (1.9% of width dropped, then upsampled to keep the output dimensions).
memory plan     : 4 canonical chunks, 1 reusable frame worker, 1 retained + 1 scratch accumulator, 1 execution threads
